# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
output/
outputs/
results/
generated/
enhanced/
processed/
temp_images/
uploads/
downloads/
*.tmp.jpg
*.tmp.jpeg
*.tmp.png
*.tmp.webp
*.tmp.gif
*.tmp.bmp
*.tmp.tiff

